+         column  Примечание
+         row  `Malformed(detail)`  1  _the key document was malformed: `detail`_  не DER, не `PrivateKeyInfo`, не `RSAPrivateKey`, усечённый контейнер OpenSSH
+         row  `Mismatch(expected, found)`  2  _a `expected` key was expected but `found` was found_  имена берутся из `KeyAlgorithm`, например `RSA-4096` и `RSA-2048`, `ECDSA P-384` и `ECDSA P-256` или `private` и `a public key block`

